@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<!-- Page hero -->
<section class="relative py-20 bg-purple-900 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
        <p class="text-purple-300 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-3">Your Information, Protected</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-5" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>
        <p class="text-purple-100 text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
            How Philisa Abafazi Bethu collects, uses, and protects the information you share with us.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-16 bg-[#fffbf5]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">Why this matters to us</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
                Reaching out for support can already feel difficult. We never want worrying about your privacy to be
                another barrier. This page explains, in plain language, what information we ask for through this
                website, why we ask for it, and what happens to it afterwards. We handle your information in line
                with South Africa's Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA).
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">What we collect</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                We only ask for what we need to understand and respond to you:
            </p>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-stone-600">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span>
                    </span>
                    <span><strong class="text-stone-800">When you request support:</strong> your name, phone number, email address (if you choose to share it), area, preferred contact method, the type of support you need, and a description of your situation.</span>
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5" aria-hidden="true">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-purple-600"></span>
                    </span>
                    <span><strong class="text-stone-800">When you contact us:</strong> your name, email, phone number, the subject of your message, and the message itself.</span>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed mt-4">
                You never need to create an account to request support or get in touch — we deliberately kept
                account creation out of this platform so that asking for help never feels like a bureaucratic hurdle.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">How we use it</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
                Information you submit is used solely to understand your request, contact you using the method you
                chose, and connect you with the right person or programme on our team. Situations you describe to us
                are read only by the staff involved in responding to you — never shared for marketing, research, or
                any other purpose without your separate, explicit consent.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">How we protect it</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
                Your information is stored securely and is only accessible to authorised Philisa Abafazi Bethu staff
                who need it to help you. We keep it only for as long as necessary to assist you and maintain
                accurate records of our work, and we do not sell or trade your information to anyone, under any
                circumstances.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">Your rights</h2>
            <p class="text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
                Under POPIA, you have the right to ask what information we hold about you, to have it corrected if
                it's wrong, or to ask us to delete it. If you'd like to do any of these, or have any questions about
                how your information is handled, contact us at
                <a href="mailto:admin@philisaabafazi.org" class="text-purple-700 font-semibold hover:text-purple-900">admin@philisaabafazi.org</a>
                and we will respond as quickly as we can.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="py-16 bg-amber-50 border-t border-amber-100 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-4" style="font-family: Lora, serif;">Still have questions?</h2>
        <p class="text-stone-600 mb-6 text-sm">We're happy to talk you through any of this before you reach out.</p>
        <a href="/Contact" class="inline-block bg-purple-700 hover:bg-purple-800 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-full transition-colors">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
</section>
